
============================================================
STATISTICAL ANALYSIS RESULTS
============================================================

Comparing System 1: gesture vs System 2: touchpad


============================================================
MENU SELECT TASK
============================================================

--- Accuracy (Categorical) ---
Correct Rate - gesture: 55.00%, touchpad: 100.00%
Chi-square test: χ²=9.1756, p=0.0025, significant

--- Efficiency ---
Normality Test:
  gesture: Normal (W=0.9463, p=0.5441)
  touchpad: Normal (W=0.9622, p=0.5893)

Descriptive Statistics:
  gesture: M=1.7197, SD=0.3527, Mdn=1.7789, n=13
  touchpad: M=0.8142, SD=0.3531, Mdn=0.8333, n=20

Comparison Test (Independent t-test):
  Statistic=7.2021, p=0.0000
  Result: SIGNIFICANT difference
  Effect size (Cohen's d): 2.5659 (large)

--- Complete Time ---
Normality Test:
  gesture: Not Normal (W=0.8303, p=0.0160)
  touchpad: Not Normal (W=0.6300, p=0.0000)

Descriptive Statistics:
  gesture: M=6.1162, SD=3.1863, Mdn=4.4653, n=13
  touchpad: M=3.4553, SD=2.3800, Mdn=2.7895, n=20

Comparison Test (Mann-Whitney U test):
  Statistic=222.0000, p=0.0007
  Result: SIGNIFICANT difference
  Effect size (Rank-biserial correlation): -0.7077 (large)

--- Moving Distance ---
Normality Test:
  gesture: Not Normal (W=0.8671, p=0.0479)
  touchpad: Normal (W=0.9215, p=0.1059)

Descriptive Statistics:
  gesture: M=368.5517, SD=178.6296, Mdn=329.4302, n=13
  touchpad: M=172.1677, SD=108.6243, Mdn=146.6499, n=20

Comparison Test (Mann-Whitney U test):
  Statistic=215.0000, p=0.0019
  Result: SIGNIFICANT difference
  Effect size (Rank-biserial correlation): -0.6538 (large)

